WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.868
Bat watched from the apple tree.

2
00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:09.363
Cow watched from the henhouse.

3
00:00:09.364 --> 00:00:12.833
Pig watched from the tractor.

4
00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:15.593
Cat watched from the windmill.

5
00:00:15.594 --> 00:00:20.474
At last the fox came.

6
00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:27.954
It looked all around.

7
00:00:27.955 --> 00:00:36.604
Then it went to the henhouse.

8
00:00:36.605 --> 00:00:41.160
"Now!" cried Bat.

9
00:00:41.161 --> 00:00:44.628
Bat swooped down at the fox.

10
00:00:44.629 --> 00:00:48.516
Cat hissed at the fox.

11
00:00:48.517 --> 00:00:53.851
Pig oinked at the fox.

12
00:00:53.852 --> 00:00:58.645
Cow mooed at the fox.

13
00:00:58.646 --> 00:01:05.510
Then they all did it again.

14
00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:08.065
Swoop!

15
00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:09.796
Hiss!

16
00:01:09.797 --> 00:01:11.147
Oink!

17
00:01:11.148 --> 00:01:13.495
Moo!

18
00:01:13.496 --> 00:01:17.762
The fox ran fast.

19
00:01:17.763 --> 00:01:24.587
The fox ran far.

20
00:01:24.588 --> 00:01:34.642
"We did it!" cried Pig.

21
00:01:34.643 --> 00:01:37.490
The noise was loud.

22
00:01:37.491 --> 00:01:48.809
It woke up Dog.

23
00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:53.585
"You were sleeping," said Cat. "So—"

24
00:01:53.586 --> 00:01:57.240
"We watched the farm!" said Pig.

25
00:01:57.241 --> 00:02:02.462
"Thank you," said Dog.

26
00:02:02.463 --> 00:02:13.711
He felt much better now.

